{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:efdb098bc15b650e","name":"Farseeing","source":{"id":"source:reference-efdb098bc15b650e","title":"Farseeing","revision":18168,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:42:07Z","sha256":"61d7d4a1164663b92c27243386c809a2d6d1e3ba5d6d20f391f66e3a1603080a","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18168","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Farseeing&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-efdb098bc15b650e","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You gain a vague, momentary impression of events happening around a particular being in some distant place.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Time:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Targets:"]}," One creature you know or have met with before.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"}," check."]}," If your result is less than the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", you gain no information (including whether the target is alive or dead) and cannot use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"}," against the same target for 24 hours. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", you can sense whether the target is alive or dead and gain a vague sense of its immediate surroundings, what it's currently doing, and any strong emotions it is presently feeling. A dead target has a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of 30 for purposes of this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Special:"]}," If you successfully use this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Power"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Power"},", you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to gain a clear mental image of the target's surroundings, as well as other creatures and objects within 6 squares of it.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
